    <briefdescription>
<para>Zero-Heap RIFF/WAVE Header Parser. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Provides a pure C99 zero-malloc streaming header parser for standard <computeroutput>.wav</computeroutput> audio container files. Supports PCM (Linear) and IMA-ADPCM compressed formats. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
